    "body": "**Correction to the body's \"Not exercised\" line:** the field engine's slowdown is **not** debug-only. The reviewer measured it in release: `drill_plate` at the default cell (0.375 mm, 320 × 320) takes ~79 s on the field engine against 0.23 s on the column engine, about 300×. The output is byte-identical; it's only speed. Filed as 633 (P1), which blocks #589. A `--help` note will say large boxes are slow until it's fixed; it goes in alongside, not by changing this reviewed head.",
